    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/c32bd4b2683e1babbb866799a5d5edbf.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/c32bd4b2683e1babbb866799a5d5edbf.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/c32bd4b2683e1babbb866799a5d5edbf.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to Crafty Crasher!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate crash playground full of contrations &amp;  chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger traps and gadgets with perfect timing to blast or rescue vehicles\u2014then twist the scene into glorious mayhem by moving parts around or crafting your own wacky contraptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash or Save \u2013 It\u2019s Up to You!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect Timing!</strong> Flip switches and hit buttons at just the right moment to help the good guys escape\u2026 or stop the bad guys as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/49556bde1fe33341157ffca43c9ea4a6.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/49556bde1fe33341157ffca43c9ea4a6.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/49556bde1fe33341157ffca43c9ea4a6.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Stunts!</strong> Launch cars off giant ramps, hurl them through obstacles, and watch them either stick the landing or crash in spectacular fashion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/53a464d6be14bda6d07d7dc1acc000b1.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=528 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/53a464d6be14bda6d07d7dc1acc000b1.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/53a464d6be14bda6d07d7dc1acc000b1.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky Contraptions!</strong> Use springboards, hammers, spinning blades, and more to trigger wild chain reactions full of surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/778b9d7d7900d5dec1028a9cdb76952b.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/778b9d7d7900d5dec1028a9cdb76952b.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/778b9d7d7900d5dec1028a9cdb76952b.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Your Creativity!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft the Chaos!</strong> Build your own cars, characters, and crazy machines with a fun cartoony 3D modeling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Sandbox Freedom!</strong> Rearrange anything\u2014blocks, gadgets, traps, physics toys\u2014and design your ultimate crash scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Mo Destruction!</strong> Enjoy every bounce, break, and blast in glorious slow motion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/eb0cf4d7b28826b0f3d8b651ee959653.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/eb0cf4d7b28826b0f3d8b651ee959653.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/eb0cf4d7b28826b0f3d8b651ee959653.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Crash Craft Community!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's build a great community</strong> to play endless custom levels made by other players\u2014there will always be something wild and new to try!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Friends!</strong> Share your trickiest scenes and see who can survive your madness or outsmart your builds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Off Your Mayhem!</strong> Post your most jaw-dropping crashes and funniest fails to entertain (or impress) the community!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/e28891df5ab8309251b3e9190256169b.poster.avif?t=1754991377\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/e28891df5ab8309251b3e9190256169b.webm?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686090/extras/e28891df5ab8309251b3e9190256169b.mp4?t=1754991377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Crafty Crasher</strong>\u00a0and try the Demo now! Let's get ready to  smash, and laugh your way through the wackiest sandbox action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
